# TypeScript Development Patterns

## Lit Component Patterns
- Use `@customElement` decorator for component registration
- Use `@state()` for reactive internal state
- Use `@property()` for external props
- Implement proper lifecycle methods (connectedCallback, disconnectedCallback)

## Audio Processing Patterns
```typescript
// Dual AudioContext pattern for input/output
private inputAudioContext = new AudioContext({sampleRate: 16000});
private outputAudioContext = new AudioContext({sampleRate: 24000});

// Proper cleanup in disconnectedCallback
disconnectedCallback() {
  this.inputAudioContext?.close();
  this.outputAudioContext?.close();
}
```

